You revel in death, devouring the souls of your victims. Whenever you inflict damage to a target, you deal an additional [11, 15, 18, 20, 23 (TL1-5; SP 100; MP 100)] darkness damage.

Additionally, you gain [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] souls whenever you score a kill.

The damage will scale with the highest of your spell or mind power and can only occur up to 25 times per turn.
